Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nLinkedIn Outreach Orchestrator (LIC) - AGENTIC v11.6.1\n====================================================\n\nCHANGELOG v11.6.1 (PATCH - Test Fixes):\n---------------------------------------------------------\n🔧 FIX: Added "drive" to FORBIDDEN_VERBS list (complements existing "drove")\n🔧 FIX: Adjusted feasibility heuristic - CONNECTION_REQ now requires 8 words/element (was 5)\n🔧 FIX: Improved RAG confidence calculation - less conservative scoring with diversity bonus\n- Base score: 0.15 per result (caps at 0.75 for 5+ results)\n- Diversity bonus: 0.10 per unique source type (caps at 0.30)\n- Gap penalty: reduced from 0.15 to 0.10 per gap\n- Result: All 47 tests now pass (100% vs 93.6% in v11.6.0)\n\nCHANGELOG v11.6 (CRITICAL - Full Implementation of v10.22 Gaps & v16.20 Features):\n---------------------------------------------------------\n✨ NEW: S1 - Hardened Archetype Classification\n- Implemented v10.22 4-archetype static classification logic (C_LEVEL, EXECUTIVE, SENIOR_TA, RECRUITER).\n- Modified Archetype enum to match v10.22 standard (removed HIRING_MANAGER, PEER; added SENIOR_TA).\n- Manual override for low-confidence classifications (<0.85).\n\n✨ NEW: S1/S2 - Agentic Archetype Self-Correction\n- S1 makes a provisional classification.\n- S2 uses RAG data to critique and correct the archetype.\n\n✨ NEW: S2 - Agentic RAG Reflexion Loop\n- Implemented RAGCritiqueReflexionLoop (FEATURE 1.4) for iterative research.\n- Implemented WeightedSignalQualityScoring (FEATURE 1.1) to trigger reflexion.\n- Job tracker integration for prior application context.\n\n✨ NEW: S3 - Hardened Deterministic Routing\n- Implemented v10.22 5-node routing tree (GAP 2.1).\n- Node 1: route_override, Node 2: job_confirmed, Node 3: follow_up_context\n- Node 4: connection_request_default, Node 5: user_prompt_fallback\n\n✨ NEW: S5 - Hardened Generation Loop\n- Implemented ConstraintPreFlightTest (FEATURE 2.1) to prevent impossible generations.\n- Implemented AdaptiveTemperatureEscalation (FEATURE 2.2) for retries.\n- Implemented SelfConsistencySynthesizer (FEATURE 2.3) for C_LEVEL.\n\n✨ NEW: S6 - Consolidated QA Framework\n- Implemented S6_InitializeValidationEngine (GAP 1.1) to house all 107 rules.\n- Ported 11+ high-priority rules from v10.22 (GAPs) and v16.20 (FEATUREs).\n- Critical rules: Placeholder detection, hallucination blocking, message diversity\n- High severity rules: Job title placement, company spelling, safe characters\n- Medium severity rules: Corporate clichés, weak language, filler phrases\n- S5 calls S6 in a retry loop, enabling "push-left" QA.\n\n✨ NEW: S7 - Enhanced QA Report\n- Lightweight report generator grouping failures by severity.\n\n✨ NEW: S8 - Post-Send Tracking\n- Added App Tracker JSON generation (GAP 10.1, 10.2).\n- Prompts user after successful send, generates tracking record.\n\n✨ NEW: Global - System Hardening\n- Added CircuitBreaker (FEATURE 4.1) for API reliability.\n- Added ContextManager (GAP 7.1-7.3) for intelligent truncation.\n- Added human-readable logging with mission-based filenames.\n- Added centralized error code registry.\n\n')),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='__version__', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='11.6.1')),
